// A documentation literal where legend-engine 4.145.0's grammar has no slot for one (Studio's grammar
// roundtrip work, 2026-11-14): the parse refuses at the keyword. Without the literal the element
// parses on both sides (doc-before-activators-and-services.pure holds the kinds that admit one).
// Here: an ExecutionEnvironment in ###HostedService, which hosts the same rule.
###HostedService
'''
A documented environment.
'''
ExecutionEnvironment fixture::neg::Env
{
   executions:
   [
      UAT:
      {
         mapping: fixture::neg::Mapping1;
         runtime: fixture::neg::Runtime1;
      }
   ];
}
